# Training JSONL embeds patch/test/grader content from an internal delivery -- not ours to
# redistribute via this repo. Distributed offline; there is no prepare script for it here.
#
# example.jsonl/example_rollouts.jsonl are the one exception, and are NOT drawn from the internal
# dataset: CI's data-validation gate (gym env test +should_validate_data=true) requires a
# committed sample, so these 5 rows are synthetic fixtures built from SWE-Gym/SWE-Gym (MIT
# licensed, public) -- the same rows swemer_v2's fixtures use -- with a small fixture
# tests/test.sh + grade.py + config.json triple that honours the delivery's grader contract
# (install $SCRIPT_DIR/test.patch, run the suite, write 0/1 to /logs/verifier/reward.txt), so they
# exercise the same verification pipeline without publishing any real delivery content.
*.jsonl
!example.jsonl
!example_rollouts.jsonl
